      "writtenOn": "2025-02-20T03:39:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Actually, i think ACTION_BLE_STATE_CHANGED is always happend and we can get STATE_BLE_ON state change if we disable BT from Bluetooth State Machine(https://docs.google.com/document/d/1rV7XTK10MNnJU4_zW4ThIlUAOQ4Ed5736IgpmcvwCvA/edit?tab\u003dt.0#heading\u003dh.s1ef2ls10l43), what ever BLE_Scan mode is enable or disable. Is that corrent?\n\nSo, what i want to make sure is that when we disable Bluetooth here, and the Bluetooth state is STATE_BLE_ON, not we can get STATE_BLE_ON state change but finally is STATE_OFF.",
      "parentUuid": "6a20d8f4_8989b6f8",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 698,
